            "action_name": {
              "value": "Sound Mimicry"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The graul can perfectly imitate the sounds and speech of other creatures by attempting a Deception check against a listener's Will DC. The graul doesn't need to understand the language it's mimicking, but when speaking a language it doesn't know, the creature can only repeat specific words and phrases it has heard in the past 24 hours. The graul can't use this ability to duplicate voice-based abilities or spells."
            },
